# NOT INSTALLED. Add to the VM's crontab only when the first manual runs have been reviewed:  crontab -e
#
# Runs at 10:00 UTC on days 6 to 12 of each month. The script does nothing once the month has loaded,
# and exits quietly if Amazon's last closed month is not in the database yet, so a late month just
# means it tries again the next day. 10:00 UTC never overlaps the Thursday 06:00 and 07:00 UTC
# amazon-sp-api-ingest jobs, and the script holds its own lock.
#
# Change the path to wherever the repository is cloned on the VM.
0 10 6-12 * *  /home/azureuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning/scripts/run_monthly.sh
# UK (add only after its back-test is reviewed). A different hour: the script uses one lock for both pools.
# 0 11 6-12 * *  POOL=UK /home/azureuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning/scripts/run_monthly.sh
